{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50866","headline":"省题诗二十一首 晓日禁林闻清漏 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 晓日禁林闻清漏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓过宫垣侧，犹闻漏水频。\n清音传五夜，山影值三春。\n露碎金壶滴，风和玉佩振。\n依稀连鳯沼，髣髴辨鸡人。\n温树初凝雾，彤闱渐向晨。\n若非鸳鹭伴，谁此继香尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}